  message: "Merged 4f6dade424 (bundle). Added dedicated detection keys (= route-YAML basename, no alias) for flask-restful/masonite (Python), lumen (PHP), restify (JS), scalatra (Scala), http4k (Kotlin) in profile.py, so a manifest/import declaring them now surfaces routes instead of zero. Removed the six from the test_route_framework_yaml_reachability exemption — the structural invariant now enforces them (RED: 6 orphaned; GREEN: reachable). node-http stays the sole exemption (generic bare-Node http builtin, cannot alias to one YAML). Core 100%."  # b923
